      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noticed this a build or two ago, but it seems like OnEnable triggers might not fire properly when attached to a spawned object. In the log, you get:\nWARNING: [VRC_TriggerInternal] <Object> deferred event Unnamed type OnEnable because nothing.\n\nFor a workaround, it is still possible to use button events, but I'll see if I can get a simple enough repro together just so that things are documented.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
